copy_file(path('code/96_metric_unit_tests.R'),file.path(pub,'tests/metric_unit_tests.R'));copy_file(path('audit/package_version_lock.tsv'),file.path(pub,'package_version_lock.tsv'));copy_file(path('audit/R_sessionInfo.txt'),file.path(pub,'R_sessionInfo.txt'))
readme<-c('# Blood SSB cognitive-disorder atlas — public-code preparation','This folder is prepared for later MANUAL upload. No upload or repository deposition has occurred.','## Fixed analysis scope','Final author list: HC144, Core 1-positive AD pathology89, Core 1-negative cognitive disorders28. EXON primary, GENE sensitivity, INTRON and TSS200 complementary. All plot calculations use R.','## Public files','Complete downstream R code, panel entry scripts and participant-free aggregate statistics. Gene-feature summary tables contain no individual counts. These reproduce aggregate analyses/plots; individual clinical and molecular panels require approved controlled inputs.','## Commands','Rscript tests/metric_unit_tests.R','Rscript code/95_public_aggregate_figures.R','With the approved CONTROLLED_REPRODUCTION project copied to a working directory: Rscript code/99_run_all.R --mode=processed','To rebuild from the original valid BEDs, provide SSB_UPSTREAM_ROOT / SSB_REFERENCE_ROOT / SSB_PROFILE_ROOT and run --mode=full. Original FASTQs are not required for this downstream workflow.','## Controlled files are not for GitHub','Never upload CONTROLLED_REPRODUCTION_DO_NOT_UPLOAD, raw clinical workbooks, sequencing files, or individual molecular/clinical matrices without the study team’s approved consent/access process. Full controlled reproduction inputs are prepared separately for authorized investigators/reviewers.','## Reproducibility','R4.5.3; package_version_lock.tsv and R_sessionInfo.txt identify dependencies. Master seed20261013. At most12 counting workers,8 modeling workers, each with1 BLAS thread, under30 total. Arial fonts are required for typography. Models use training-fold-only detection/imputation/nuisance regression/scaling/selection/tuning.','## Licence and citation','Authors must approve the software/data licences before public upload. No licence is asserted automatically. Cite the final manuscript when publication details are available, together with the 2019 SSiNGLe and 2024 Aging Cell foundation studies.','## Input availability','Public aggregates cannot reconstruct participant-level observations. No toy data is presented as patient findings; the toy unit test checks algebra only.')
writeLines(readme,file.path(pub,'README.md'))
